    "key": "component::esphome::issues::device_conflict::fix_flow::step::init::description",
    "key_id": "635178283",
    "translation_id": "5597163204",
    "en": "**The device `{name}` (`{model}`) at `{ip}` has reported a MAC address change from `{stored_mac}` to `{mac}`.**\n\nIf you have multiple devices with the same name, please rename or remove the one with MAC address `{mac}` to avoid conflicts.\n\nIf this is a hardware replacement, please confirm that you would like to migrate the Home Assistant configuration to the new device with MAC address `{mac}`.",
    "sv": "**Enheten `{name}` (`{model}`) på `{ip}` har rapporterat att MAC-adressen har ändrats från `{stored_mac}` till `{mac}`.**\n\nOm flera enheter har samma namn måste du byta namn på eller ta bort enheten med MAC-adressen `{mac}` för att undvika konflikter.\n\nOm du byter ut en befintlig enhet kan du bekräfta att Home Assistant-konfigurationen ska migreras till den nya enheten med MAC-adressen `{mac}`.",
    "verification_method": "Lokalise API current-value read; pinned Home Assistant Core source and live-reference check",
    "source_revision": "86a2eabe7e43f526db5821ef068087ce8404ae07",
